The '''Secretariat of Local Administration and Modernization''' ({{Lang-bl|Secretaria de Administración Local y Modernización}}, '''SECALM''') is a [[Balisca|Baliscan]] [[Secretariat Council (Balisca)|secretariat]] established in 1923. It is responsible for overseeing the implementation of [[Confederal initiative|confederal initiatives]], especially regarding [[W:Housing|housing]] and construction, regional and rural policies such as [[W:Rural internet|rural internet]] rollout, [[Communes of Balisca|communal]] and [[Cantons of Balisca|cantonal]] administration and finances, and the conduct of [[Elections in Balisca|elections]].

